# Top-down detail pass: 400 km straight above the sub-solar point, slow pan.
# Finest terrain LOD (full fbm3/water.frag cost per pixel), most vertices
# displaced, sun near zenith. (Subsolar key yaw 90 = straight above.)
view orbit
pivot subsolar
poff 0
frames 480
simtime 0
key 0   400000 90  0
key 480 400000 115 0
